Data licence for geodata-kit-tz
===============================

The file data/timezones.bin is a derived database made from the timezone
boundaries of timezone-boundary-builder
(https://github.com/evansiroky/timezone-boundary-builder, release 2026f),
which are based on OpenStreetMap data.

  © OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)

