https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

How it was derived: polygons were simplified (Douglas–Peucker, tolerance
0.001°), quantised to 1/10,000 degree and packed with a 1°×1° grid index by
scripts/build/tz.ts in the geodata-kit repository, which is the means of
reproducing it from the source.

